  "_roles": {
    "text-3": "Mitoshi's ink-muted #737373 / #7C7466 is under 4.5:1 on the ground, so readable tertiary text uses ink-secondary; ink-muted is kept for decoration (key hints, rules, disabled).",
    "accent": "The fill role (Mitoshi accent-fill): #E04D26 dark, #B83214 light, with on-accent ink. The line and mark vermilion is `vermilion` (#E04D26 / #D93E1F).",
    "primary-pressed-foreground": "No ink reaches 4.5:1 on both #E04D26 and #B83A1B, so a pressed fill takes white (dark) / cream (light).",
    "link": "Mitoshi accent-hover (vermilion 84 % with white) in dark: #E04D26 text is 4.47:1 on surface-1. Light uses accent-fill #B83214.",
    "up-surface": "Dark: Mitoshi's 14 % profit/loss wash. Light: the 14 % wash leaves #C2381F at 3.8:1, so light washes are surface-3 #FBF7EE with the ink border.",
    "warn": "Light: #F2994A is not text on cream; warning text uses accent-fill #B83214 on the warning wash.",
    "plate": "Mitoshi's money card (Owarine's black plate): the ink plate on cream; on the near-black dark stage pure black reads as a hole, so it is the card surface with the strong edge. What sits on it is white in both themes, with Mitoshi's leg stickers."
  },
